{"product_id":"kiss-the-bride-angel-food-just-deserts-a-recipe-for-romance-tea-for-two-heartsong-novella-collection","title":"Kiss the Bride: Angel Food\/Just Deserts\/A Recipe for Romance\/Tea for Two (Heartsong Novella Collection)","description":"\u003cp\u003eFour young women meet at a restaurant owner's conference-Angel from Florida, Monica from Missouri, Haley from Oklahoma, and Allison from New Jersey-and discover they share the same faiths, fears, and hopes, including a lack of a love story in their lives. They vow to keep in touch, pray for one another, and meet again at next year's conference. What happens in between is an absolute smorgasbord of changed lives, challenged faiths, new dedications and directions, and romantic twists that turn next year's conference reunion plans into reservations for eight. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:130 x 196  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Kristy Dykes \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781597893534 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 368\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44896136003737,"sku":"13RA9781597893534","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/33852942cf522beca2e0a99602816915.jpg?v=1728897182","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/kiss-the-bride-angel-food-just-deserts-a-recipe-for-romance-tea-for-two-heartsong-novella-collection","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}